window.products.push({"id":107414,"name":"Beaquicy W10196405 and W10196406 Chrome Drip Pan- Replacement for Ken-more and Whirlpool Range - 4 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GzuPGYojL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【8 INCH W10196405 & 6 INCH W10196406】-- The package includes 2 x W10196405 8 inch stove top drip pan and 2 x W10196406 6 inch stove top drip pan. Sliver color, using eco-friendly plating techniques.The drip pan can fit the stove properly and prevent swinging drip pan elements, thus preventing cookware from rocking on the stove. Catch spills from the cookware on the surface burner(oil/water droplets/food). Speeds cooking time saving energy and makes cook top look new again. ✅【EASY TO CLEAN】-- The Drip pan WPW10196406 and WPW10196405 catches spills from the cookware on the surface burner. They are made of high quality metal,durable, stick free. The burner drip pans are also easy to clean and can be cleaned with cloth, paper towel, soap or even dishwasher, make your Kitchen clean and tidy. If your old drip tray is dirty or rusted, this replacement can fix it and keep your stove looking like new. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The stove burner covers drip pan W10196405 and W10196406 supports 365 days RETURN and EXCHANGE. ▶For safety precautions, make sure to unplug the range from the power source and wait until the surface is cool before replacing this part. Wait until the surface is cool to the touch before installing the drip pans for electric stove Remove the element from the stove top, and pull out the old drip pan, prevent burns. ✅【COMPATIBILITY】-- The W10196405 W10196406 drip pan replacement for Ken-more and Whir-lpool range. ►W10196405 8 inch drip bowl replaces these parts 102, 0042142, 0042169, 0064676, 0075482, 0087550, 0087552, 0087838, 0088810, 0089285, 0091813, 0304979, 0310228, 0310681, 0B04300211, 0P00800511,etc. ►W10196406 6 inch drip bowl replaces these parts 101, 101A, 101AM, 256691, 296481, 1065207, 1065209, 1065210, 14200056, 14200209, 14203427, 14205045, 14205549, 14210002, 14211601,etc. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】-- Before reinstalling the W10196405 stove top drip pan and W10196406 6 inch stove top drip pan, make sure the bowl is flat. First, simply remove the burner element, remove the old bowl, and then align the holes on the new bowl with the junction box and place it in place. When removing the components, check whether the terminals are corroded, damaged or discolored. No tools are required to install this component, anyone can install it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GzuPGYojL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08H7VLN43","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-107414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H7VLN43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H7VLN43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
