window.products.push({"id":107774,"name":"DD94-01002A Dishwasher Assembly-Install Kit by Beaquicy - Replacement for Samsung Dishwashers - Includes 2 Mounting Brackets and 6 Mounting Screws - R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Sv670OTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【DD94-01002A DISHWASHER INSTALLATION KIT】- The DD94-01002A Dishwasher Assembly-mounting Kit is used to secure the dishwasher in the kitchen cabinet. It prevents the dishwasher from tipping over if you slide it off the shelf. To keep your kitchen safe, replace any piece of the assembly kit if it is broken or missing. ►The mounting kit is made of high quality material, making the kit stronger, less prone to wear and tear, less prone to bending, better able to withstand the weight of the dishwasher, without the gravity of the dishwasher making the rack fall off the cabinet and causing the dishwasher to come loose and fall off. It can be easily replaced and fixed while extending its life. ✅【2 x Brackets, 6 x Screws】- DD94-01002A Dishwasher Brackets and Clips contains 2 x Brackets and 6 x Screws(3 Different Sizes). The package comes with 3 different sizes of screws to better adapt to different sizes of dishwashers and cabinets, able to secure the dishwasher firmly while ensuring that the screws are not exposed beyond their thickness, maintaining the aesthetic appeal. ►The size of DD94-01002A mounting bracket is approximately 3.47 inches in length, 0.58 inches in high, 0.98 inches in wide. Tools needed: phillips head screwdriver, flat head screwdriver, 5/8 inch wrench, 9/64 inch hex head screwdriver, pliers. ✅【90 DAYS WARRANTY】- The DD94-01002A Samsung Dishwasher Bracket Kit support 90 DAYS return and exchange and when you are not satisfied with anything , you can ask for a replacement or a refund. ►The DD94-01002A Dishwasher Mounting Install Kit is made of high quality stainless steel metal materials for excellent durability and firmness. It makes the kit less likely to be bent and allows for better fixing of the dishwasher in the cabinet. ►The DD94-01002A Dishwasher Bracket Kit can solve the FOLLOWING SYMPTOMS: The old one is damaged. Dishwasher moves. Dishwasher falling off cabinet. Dishwasher will tilt forward. Dishwasher shakes. ✅【SUITABLE FOR MANY BRANDS】- The DD94-01002A Dishwasher Mounting Bracket fits for Samsung dishwashers. Replaces 2077601, AP4450818, PS4222710, EAP4222710, PD00007402. ►Replaced the model of Samsung dishwashers like: DMT400RHS/XAA, DW80F600UTS/AA, DW80F600UTS/AA-01, DW80F600UTS/AC, DMR78AHS/XAA-00, DW80K5050US/AA, DW80K5050US/AA-00, DW80K5050US/AA-01, DW80K5050US/AA-02, DW80K5050US/AA-03, DW80F600UTB/AA, DW80F600UTB/AA-01, DW80F600UTB/AC, DW80F600UTW/AA, DW80F600UTW/AA-01, DW80F600UTW/AC, DW80K5050UG/AA, DW80K5050UG/AA-00, DW80K5050UG/AA-01, DW80K5050UG/AA-02, DW80K5050UG/AA-03, DW80F800UWS/AA, DW80F800UWS/AA-01, DW80F800UWS/AC, DW80F800UWS/AC-01, DW80K7050UG/AA, DW80K7050UG/AA-00, etc. ✅【FIT MANY MODELS】- The Dishwasher Mounting Bracket DD94-01002A can also fit the following models: DW80J3020US/AA, DW80J3020US/AA-00, DW80J3020US/AA-01, DW80J3020US/AC, DW80K7050US/AA, DW80K7050US/AA-00, DW80K7050US/AA-01, DW80K7050US/AA-02, DW80K7050US/AA-03, DW80K5050UB/AA, DW80K5050UB/AA-00, DW80K5050UB/AA-01, DW80K5050UB/AA-02, DW80K5050UB/AC, DW80K5050UW/AA, DW80K5050UW/AA-00, DW80K5050UW/AA-01, DW80K5050UW/AA-02, DW80K5050UW/AA-03, DW80K5050UW/AC, DW80J3020UB/AA, DW80J3020UB/AA-00, DW80J3020UB/AA-01, DW80J3020UB/AC, DW80J3020UW/AA, DW80J3020UW/AA-00, DW80J3020UW/AC, DW7933LRASR/AA, DW80K2021US/AC, DMT400RHBXAA, DMT800RHS/XAA, DW80R5060UG/AA, DW80R5060US/AA, DW80R5061US/AA, etc. ✅【EASY INSTALLATION】-- The installation of DD94-01002A Dishwasher Mounting Bracket is simple. Before installation, please disconnect the power and water supply and put on working gloves to protect your hands. Determine the position of the mounting brackets, insert the mounting brackets into the dishwasher rack, screw them through the round holes in the brackets and fix them in the cabinet. NOTE: After installation, please shake the dishwasher with some force to see if it will shake. If it does, please continue to tighten the screws to ensure that the dishwasher does not wobble and fall out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Sv670OTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B086BZY57F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-107774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086BZY57F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B086BZY57F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
