window.products.push({"id":108001,"name":"RecPro RV Refrigerator Black Glass | 10.7 Cubic Feet Refrigerator | 12-Volt | 2 Door Fridge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513mlz3iD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Every RVer needs a good reliable refrigerator in their rig! A refrigerator in your RV lets you keep food fresh and cold as you travel or as you while away the time at your campground. Without a refrigerator, you would be stuck to canned foods, takeout, or fast food. This 10.7 cubic foot 2-door refrigerator may be just what you need! Convenient Food Storage It may seem obvious, but the main advantage of having a refrigerator like this one is that it allows you to store fresh food items such as raw meat safely. However, this refrigerator is also a freezer, allowing you to store frozen food items as well, such as ice cream! This 10.7 cubic foot interior gives you plenty of food storage space. At the same time, the spacious door shelving is great for storing condiments, beverages, and more. Sturdy, Reliable This refrigerator is designed for the RV lifestyle. It runs using 12v DC power and does not require any venting to install. Its durable construction resists denting and other forms of damage, and a built-in door lock keeps the refrigerator door closed while you are traveling. This refrigerator/freezer combo even has a frost-free design, meaning you will not have to deal with the process of defrosting and will have less maintenance to do. Looks Great This 10.7 cubic foot refrigerator has outer dimensions measuring 23.9\" W x 59.7\" H x 26.5\" D. It is black in color while featuring a matching black glass front panel. This gives the refrigerator a sleek and modern appearance. Inside, this refrigerator has bright LED lighting for superb illumination and digital temperature settings that are very easy to read.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513mlz3iD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RecPro","source_asin":"B0BL1MNTMS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-108001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL1MNTMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL1MNTMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
